# D3-BD-002: Known boundary: emulsifying oil need not speed the aggregate lipase model
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 vegetable_oil 1g
add v1 dish_soap 0.3g
add v1 lipase 0.05g
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 vegetable_oil 1g
add v2 lipase 0.05g
stir v1 500rpm 30s
stir v2 500rpm 30s
wait 30min
look v1
look v2
inspect
